        <name>PayloadWriter</name>
        <qualifiedname>paimon::FileIndexFormat::Writer::PayloadWriter</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Writes one payload without closing the stream. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns false for an absent index (without writing bytes), or true after writing a non-empty payload. The borrowed stream reports positions relative to the start of this payload, starting at 0. The callback must not retain the stream. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
